@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;motion] share-sheet-fades-by-itself
What shows after something is shared into Inventory MUST go away by itself: once
everything is saved, or kept on the phone while offline, it waits 5 seconds and
fades out, and a sheet saying nothing was saved waits 8 seconds. The wait MUST
NOT start while saving is still going, nor while Inventory is still finding tags
for one thing shared (share-sheet-shows-thymind-tags), for at most 10 reads. Any touch on the sheet or its scrim, or
typing in it, MUST stop the wait and keep it open until Done, its cross, the
scrim, Back or a drag closes it; tapping outside closes it at once. While it
waits, the Done button shows the time left as a lighter part that shrinks. It
MUST NOT block the other app longer than that wait, and the wait MUST last as
long with the system's animations turned off. Spaces, tags and a note added
before it goes MUST still reach the saved cards, however it closes. After the
shooting star (share-moment-shooting-star) its tag step waits the same way,
from when the card has turned over; the star's own play before it, which a tap
skips, and the flight into the backpack after it come on top of that wait.
Source: Tavi's Cap recording of the share prototype, 29 October 2026: "it has to
be something that goes away by itself ... if I don't tap anything, not something
that I have to close"; "we do not want to block people". The shooting star's
play time comes from Tavi's request of 5 November 2026 to build it into the app.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;design] share-field-takes-everything
The share sheet MUST be Pully's paper over the app that shared, resting at its
content's height, titled with how saving is going (Saving to your mind, Saved to
your mind, Kept on this phone, Nothing was saved). It MUST show what was saved
as a raised row with its picture and two lines, filling in the page's title and
picture as Inventory reads them; then the spaces, tags and note added, each with a
cross that takes it off; then one field, Add a space, a tag or a note. With
nothing typed, the field offers the suggested space and recent tags; typed words
offer the spaces and tags that hold them, a new tag for one word no tag matches,
and Use as your note for words with a space. Enter adds the first row.
This sheet shows when the shooting star does not play (share-moment-shooting-star):
with the system's animations turned off, and when nothing was saved; otherwise
the star's tag step (share-tag-step-icon-grid) takes its place.
Source: Tavi's pick of 10, One field for everything, in the share prototype,
29 October 2026 ("Let's do 10"). Inventory's own tags show above the field
(share-sheet-shows-thymind-tags), so the empty field offers recent tags. The tag
step took its place with Tavi's pick of M9 Icon grid, 5 November 2026.

